#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 070c704819e4428db757174bf41b5c3c Models.ipynb:9
#: Series Time
msgid "Time Series Models"
msgstr "时间序列模型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:11 Series Time
#: e7b294e201d147d3ba70ac806333d86f
msgid ""
"**PyBroker v2** introduces support for backtesting time series models. "
"Instead of training on examples individually, these models make "
"predictions based on a series' own past values."
msgstr "**PyBroker v2** 引入了对时间序列模型回测的支持。这类模型不是逐个样本单独训练，而是基于序列自身的历史值进行预测。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:13 Series Time
#: d38c69a91cb1404780181151dccfad3d
msgid ""
"To show how this works, we will backtest two different strategies. The "
"first relies on a volatility forecast from a `GARCH(1,1) "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Autoregressive_conditional_heteroskedasticity>`__"
" model built with the `arch <https://arch.readthedocs.io/>`__ library. "
"The second strategy uses a rolling regression that is refit on every bar."
" Since **PyBroker** does not include ``arch`` by default, you must "
"install it first by running ``pip install arch``."
msgstr ""
"为了展示其工作原理，我们将回测两种不同的策略。第一种策略依赖于使用 `arch <https://arch.readthedocs.io/>`__"
" 库构建的 `GARCH(1,1) "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Autoregressive_conditional_heteroskedasticity>`__"
" 模型给出的波动率预测。第二种策略使用一个在每根 K 线上都重新拟合的滚动回归模型。由于 **PyBroker** 默认不包含 "
"``arch``，你必须先运行 ``pip install arch`` 进行安装。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 9798668912584e8d8fa4707eee449dae Models.ipynb:66
#: Series Time
msgid "Forecasting Volatility with GARCH"
msgstr "使用 GARCH 预测波动率"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 1e93ea2ee2a4407cb846907512cca73a Models.ipynb:68
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"GARCH will model the volatility of a return series, so we start by "
"defining an `indicator "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.indicator>`__"
" for log returns:"
msgstr ""
"GARCH 用于对收益率序列的波动率进行建模，因此我们首先为对数收益率定义一个 `indicator "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.indicator>`__："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 256fa829d29a4eb4af4ba0fa89fbfcd3 Models.ipynb:96
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"The training function scales the log returns to percentages for more "
"reliable estimation:"
msgstr "训练函数会将对数收益率缩放为百分比，以获得更可靠的估计："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:128 Series Time
#: c350d79de72f4779b76fa6c794bfeecb
msgid ""
"The model is built using the combined returns from both the train and "
"test windows. Passing ``last_obs`` ensures that parameter estimation "
"relies solely on the train window and isolates the test returns to "
"prevent data leakage."
msgstr ""
"该模型使用训练窗口和测试窗口合并后的收益率进行构建。传入 ``last_obs`` "
"可确保参数估计仅依赖训练窗口，并将测试收益率隔离开来，以防止数据泄漏。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:130 Series Time
#: f38c38093b4b4597bafd415a366c4862
msgid ""
"For every test data bar, the prediction function uses the trained model "
"to forecast the variance of the next bar:"
msgstr "对于每根测试数据 K 线，预测函数都会使用已训练的模型来预测下一根 K 线的方差："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 140a3ce684ff45be8b24330b851c3e00 Models.ipynb:158
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"Because the model already stores the full return series, the model input "
"is the location of the current bar. By doing this, the forecast then only"
" uses returns up to that point."
msgstr "由于模型已经保存了完整的收益率序列，因此模型的输入为当前 K 线的位置。由此，预测过程只会使用到该位置为止的收益率数据。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:160 Series Time
#: b01993f8846743d1a34c0e2c09812b04
msgid ""
"By default, **PyBroker** passes all test window data to the model in a "
"single call to make a make a prediction. While this vectorized approach "
"is efficient, it fails for autoregressive models since they rely on the "
"previous step's output to generate their next forecast. Passing "
"``per_bar=True`` to `pybroker.model(...) "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" will cause the `predict_fn "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" to be called once per bar of input:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，**PyBroker** "
"会在一次调用中将全部测试窗口数据传给模型以生成预测。这种向量化的方式虽然高效，但并不适用于自回归模型，因为这类模型需要依赖上一步的输出来生成下一次预测。此时，向"
" `pybroker.model(...) "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" 传入 ``per_bar=True`` 会使 `predict_fn "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" 针对每根输入 K 线调用一次："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 646bfc377b7944fdbbfb66a14b7e3dd7 Models.ipynb:188
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"The strategy then uses the volatility forecast from `ctx.preds "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.preds>`__"
" as a regime filter. It enters a long position when forecast volatility "
"is below the threshold, and exits when it rises above:"
msgstr ""
"该策略接着将 `ctx.preds "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.preds>`__"
" 给出的波动率预测用作市场状态过滤器：当预测波动率低于阈值时进场做多，并在波动率升至阈值以上时离场："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 3e344c25bb394c21b94bb57e514f503c Models.ipynb:718
#: Series Time
msgid "Random Forest on Lagged Returns"
msgstr "基于滞后收益率的随机森林"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 044ad0df72b04f688be4f49f5446a2db Models.ipynb:720
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"The second strategy trains a `RandomForestRegressor <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.ensemble.RandomForestRegressor.html>`__"
" to predict the next bar's return from lagged returns:"
msgstr ""
"第二种策略训练一个 `RandomForestRegressor <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.ensemble.RandomForestRegressor.html>`__，根据滞后收益率来预测下一根"
" K 线的收益率："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:749 Series Time
#: f4898f7d57fc40bc835ba0cc52927cce
msgid ""
"The training function receives ``lag_train`` and ``lag_test`` parameters "
"built from configuring the model with the desired number of `lags "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__."
" Each parameter is a feature matrix containing one row per example. These"
" rows begin with the bar's ``log_return`` value, followed by its lagged "
"return values."
msgstr ""
"训练函数会接收 ``lag_train`` 和 ``lag_test`` 参数，二者是通过为模型配置所需数量的 `lags "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" 而构建的。每个参数都是一个特征矩阵，每个样本对应一行；这些行以该 K 线的 ``log_return`` 值开头，后面跟着其滞后收益率值。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:751 Series Time
#: f2c82ddf977d4ea592b776f3d4ae4aae
msgid ""
"Unlike the per-bar GARCH model, the ``predict_fn`` uses **PyBroker's** "
"default behavior and passes the entire test window in a single call to "
"generate the model's predictions:"
msgstr ""
"与逐 K 线计算的 GARCH 模型不同，``predict_fn`` 使用 **PyBroker** "
"的默认行为，在一次调用中传入整个测试窗口以生成模型的预测结果："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 1857feda91b44249aa838750d7b0d256 Models.ipynb:773
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"Registering the model with `lags "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" set to ``3`` will include the past three lagged values for each column "
"declared in `lag_cols "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__:"
msgstr ""
"在注册模型时将 `lags "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" 设为 ``3``，会为 `lag_cols "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" 中声明的每一列都包含过去三个滞后值："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 6baca816447c487ba1730cd6cb94fd17 Models.ipynb:800
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"The strategy buys when `ctx.preds "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.preds>`__"
" for the next-bar return is positive and exits when it is negative. We "
"then run a `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`__"
" backtest:"
msgstr ""
"当下一根 K 线收益率的 `ctx.preds "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.preds>`__"
" 为正时，该策略买入；为负时平仓。接着，我们运行一次 `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`__"
" 回测："

